---
name: panels/notes-list
description: "Panel line: when the model should answer from the user's shared notes."
version: 1
output: json
variables: []
---
notes_list {scope: all|mine} whenever the request involves the user's shared notes (list them, find a note's title, plan around them, summarize). Renders their REAL rows, so it is the only component allowed to answer with note content. scope: mine ONLY when the user asks for their own notes; all otherwise. Always send scope inside props.
